    "An empty stomach is the usual trigger. Small and often beats three meals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An empty stomach is the usual trigger. Small and often beats three meals."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perut kosong biasanya menjadi pemicu. Makan sedikit tapi sering lebih baik daripada tiga kali makan besar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空腹がきっかけになることがよくあります。1日3回にまとめず、少量ずつこまめに食べましょう。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een lege maag is vaak de aanleiding. Eet liever kleine beetjes verspreid over de dag dan drie maaltijden."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O estômago vazio costuma ser o gatilho. Coma pouco e com frequência em vez de fazer três refeições."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пустой желудок часто провоцирует недомогание. Попробуй есть понемногу и чаще, а не три раза в день."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ท้องว่างมักเป็นตัวกระตุ้น ลองกินทีละน้อยแต่บ่อยครั้งแทนสามมื้อ"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bụng đói thường là yếu tố khởi phát. Ăn nhiều bữa nhỏ tốt hơn ăn ba bữa lớn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空腹是常见诱因。少食多餐比一日三餐更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An unhurried, regular tap you can rest your attention on while a wave passes. Nudge the level until it is clear but not annoying." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An unhurried, regular tap you can rest your attention on while a wave passes. Nudge the level until it is clear but not annoying."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketukan teratur dengan tempo santai yang bisa kamu jadikan fokus saat rasa tidak nyaman berlalu. Sesuaikan tingkatnya hingga terasa jelas tanpa mengganggu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "波が過ぎるまで意識を向けられる、ゆっくりと規則的なタップ。はっきり感じられ、気になりすぎない強さに調整してください。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een rustige, regelmatige tik waarop je je aandacht kunt richten terwijl een golf voorbijgaat. Pas de sterkte aan tot je de tik duidelijk voelt, zonder dat die stoort."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um toque regular e tranquilo para você acompanhar com atenção enquanto a sensação passa. Ajuste o nível até senti-lo claramente, sem incomodar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Неспешные равномерные постукивания, на которых можно сосредоточиться, пока приступ проходит. Настрой уровень так, чтобы постукивания были ощутимыми, но не раздражали."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "การแตะเป็นจังหวะสบายๆ ให้คุณจดจ่อระหว่างที่ความรู้สึกนั้นค่อยๆ ผ่านไป ปรับระดับจนสัมผัสได้ชัดแต่ไม่รำคาญ"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tập trung vào nhịp gõ đều, thong thả trong khi cơn khó chịu qua đi. Chỉnh mức sao cho bạn cảm nhận rõ mà không thấy khó chịu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不适袭来时，把注意力放在舒缓、规律的轻振上。调整强度，以能清楚感觉到但不觉得烦为宜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At the peak, or on the way down." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the peak, or on the way down."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saat memuncak atau mulai mereda."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ピークのとき、または落ち着いてきたとき。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Op het hoogtepunt of als het afneemt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No auge ou começando a passar."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "На пике или уже идёт на спад."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ช่วงที่รู้สึกมากที่สุดหรือกำลังลดลง"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đang ở đỉnh điểm hoặc dịu dần."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正处于高峰，或正在消退。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-renews unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auto-renews unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel in Settings."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diperpanjang otomatis kecuali dibatalkan minimal 24 jam sebelum periode berakhir. Kelola atau batalkan di Pengaturan."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "期間終了の24時間以上前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。管理や解約は「設定」で行えます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wordt automatisch verlengd, tenzij je minstens 24 uur voor het einde van de huidige periode opzegt. Beheer of zeg op in Instellingen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Renovação automática, a menos que você cancele pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período atual. Gerencie ou cancele em Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Подписка продлевается автоматически, если не отменить её как минимум за 24 часа до конца текущего периода. Управление и отмена в Настройках."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ต่ออายุอัตโนมัติเว้นแต่ยกเลิกอย่างน้อย 24 ชั่วโมงก่อนสิ้นสุดรอบปัจจุบัน จัดการหรือยกเลิกได้ในการตั้งค่า"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tự động gia hạn trừ khi bạn hủy ít nhất 24 giờ trước khi kỳ hiện tại kết thúc. Quản lý hoặc hủy trong Cài đặt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则将自动续订。在“设置”中管理或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
