    "This device has no haptic engine, so it cannot play a pattern you can feel. Tone still works here, and wrist sessions need an Apple Watch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device has no haptic engine, so it cannot play a pattern you can feel. Tone still works here, and wrist sessions need an Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perangkat ini tidak memiliki mesin haptik, jadi kamu tidak bisa merasakan polanya. Tone tetap bisa digunakan di sini, dan sesi di pergelangan tangan memerlukan Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このデバイスには触覚エンジンがないため、体感できるパターンを再生できません。Toneはこのデバイスでも使えます。手首でのセッションにはApple Watchが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit apparaat heeft geen haptische motor en kan dus geen voelbaar patroon afspelen. Tone werkt hier wel. Voor sessies op je pols heb je een Apple Watch nodig."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este aparelho não tem motor tátil, então não é possível sentir um padrão de toques nele. Você ainda pode usar Tone aqui. Para sessões no pulso, você precisa de um Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "На этом устройстве нет тактильного привода, поэтому почувствовать ритм не получится. Здесь можно использовать Tone, а для сеансов на запястье нужны Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "อุปกรณ์นี้ไม่มีระบบสั่น จึงเล่นรูปแบบการสั่นที่คุณรู้สึกได้ไม่ได้ คุณยังใช้ Tone บนอุปกรณ์นี้ได้ ส่วนเซสชันที่ข้อมือต้องใช้ Apple Watch"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thiết bị này không có bộ rung nên không thể phát nhịp rung để bạn cảm nhận. Bạn vẫn có thể dùng Tone tại đây. Các phiên trên cổ tay cần có Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台设备没有触感引擎，无法播放你能感受到的节奏。你仍可以在此使用 Tone，手腕练习则需要 Apple Watch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the session from your history permanently." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This removes the session from your history permanently."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sesi ini akan dihapus secara permanen dari riwayatmu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このセッションは履歴から完全に削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hiermee verwijder je de sessie definitief uit je geschiedenis."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
